The Great Heart Tree is heading toward us!

00:06:33.690 --> 00:06:34.990
Huh?!

00:06:36.320 --> 00:06:37.460
It'sh over there!

00:06:37.800 --> 00:06:40.120
Over there... You mean in the sky?

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.040
We need to get there as soon as we can!

00:06:42.560 --> 00:06:44.400
Get there? How?

00:06:44.400 --> 00:06:46.010
Just leave it to us!

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:58.780
These are... capes? {Changing manteaux to capes, because that is such a random fucking word. I wish we could just make it capes. Can we?}

