Ichuki, will you pleashe help me protect the Great Heart Tree?

00:07:10.040 --> 00:07:11.200
Of course I will.

00:07:12.040 --> 00:07:14.490
I'll help you to the best of my ability.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:17.710
Anything you want to protect, I'll gladly protect as well. {Because the things Potpourri wants to protect, I want to protect too.}{BLAH BLAH WORDING FUCK. Leaving as the literal Moon as a basis for any rewording but maybe "If you want to protect it, Potpourri, then I do too." or something.} {Put forth an idea.}

