All right then!

00:07:24.740 --> 00:07:26.320
Let's fly!{ENGRISH}

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:27.610
Okay!

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:52.290
This cape is totally awesome! Yahoo! {manteau -> cape}

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.880
Erika, you're a good flier!

00:07:54.880 --> 00:07:57.440
