00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:30.740
R-Right! Thank you.

00:08:32.010 --> 00:08:38.080
Being able to smile always gives me courage

00:08:38.620 --> 00:08:45.120
And sometimes, even my tears seem like little blessings

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:51.250
You see, what lets me press on, no matter how worried I am

00:08:51.770 --> 00:08:56.910
