00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:35.260
And that's when we'll become the flowers of the future

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:04.220
That'sh the Great Heart Tree!

00:10:13.660 --> 00:10:16.210
Nice to meet you. I'm Hanasaki Tsubomi!

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.510
