00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.280
I see.{THEN IT KNOWS MY DEEPEST SECRET. IT MUST DIE. NOW IT KNOWS OF MY FORBIDDEN LOVE FOR IT, THERE IS NO LONGER MEANING IN KEEPING UP THIS CHARADE.}{But the branch porn, man! Think of those leafy boughs!}

