00:11:04.960 --> 00:11:05.720
Right...{See Pod Notes} {Note Pod Notes} {coffret is enunciating the japanese onomatopoeia for a sort of stretchy "yes yes whatever" type yawn here, which is "afu". Part of me wants to sub it just because it's Hoshii Miki's catchphrase from im@s but, uh... not sure if that's a good idea or, indeed, how to do it. XD} {I'd like to put an actual sub here. I think leaving it untranslated would be a bit jarring - how about "Sure..." or "Right..." as two options?}

